What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/nitro_sense/
What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/predator_sense/
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		Settings offered by Acer's NitroSense or PredatorSense utility.
		Nitro laptops get the nitro_sense group and Predator laptops the
		predator_sense group, with the same attributes. Each attribute is
		present only on models known to support it. The layout follows
		Linuwu-Sense, so that tools written for it keep working.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/fan_speed
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) CPU and GPU fan speeds as percentages, written and read as
		"cpu,gpu". A speed of 0 returns that fan to automatic control,
		and "100,100" selects the firmware's maximum fan mode. Reads
		return the last values written, since not every model can
		report them. Where the hwmon pwm attributes are available, they
		control the same fans.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/battery_limiter
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) Limits battery charging to 80% when set to 1.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/battery_calibration
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) Starts battery calibration when set to 1, and stops it
		when set to 0. Calibration charges the battery to 100%, drains
		it to 0% and charges it again, to recalibrate the fuel gauge.
		The laptop must stay on AC power throughout.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/usb_charging
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) Charging of USB devices while the laptop is off. One of:

		==  ==============================================
		0   disabled
		10  enabled until the battery drops below 10%
		20  enabled until the battery drops below 20%
		30  enabled until the battery drops below 30%
		==  ==============================================

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/backlight_timeout
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) Turns the keyboard backlight off after 30 seconds without
		input when set to 1.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/lcd_override
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) LCD overdrive, which reduces the panel's response time,
		when set to 1.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/boot_animation_sound
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) The firmware's boot animation and sound, when set to 1.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/{nitro,predator}_sense/version
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RO) Version of this driver package. Read by DAMX.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/four_zoned_kb/four_zone_mode
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) Lighting effect of a four-zone RGB keyboard, as
		"mode,speed,brightness,direction,red,green,blue".

		==========  =================================================
		mode        0 static, 1 breathing, 2 neon, 3 wave,
		            4 shifting, 5 zoom, 6 meteor, 7 twinkling
		speed       0 to 9
		brightness  0 to 100
		direction   1 right to left, 2 left to right; required by
		            wave and shifting, ignored by other effects
		red, green,
		blue        0 to 255
		==========  =================================================

		Values the chosen effect does not use are cleared: speed and
		direction for static and breathing, colour and direction for
		neon, colour for wave, and direction for zoom, meteor and
		twinkling.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/acer-wmi/four_zoned_kb/per_zone_mode
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	out of tree
Description:
		(RW) Static colour of each zone of a four-zone RGB keyboard,
		as "RRGGBB,RRGGBB,RRGGBB,RRGGBB,brightness", zones from left
		to right in hexadecimal and brightness from 0 to 100.
